1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,730
RecceFlow puts the field visit in your hands.

2
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:08,432
On a phone or tablet, open your assigned jobs, check the shop and client, and start the recce.

3
00:00:08,917 --> 00:00:10,720
Begin with the site details.

4
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:14,971
Allow device location when available, or type the correct address.

5
00:00:14,971 --> 00:00:18,706
Add the contact and any instructions needed for the visit.

6
00:00:19,167 --> 00:00:21,131
Explain what you see on site.

7
00:00:21,131 --> 00:00:26,075
Type your notes about access, mounting and power, or record a voice note.

8
00:00:26,075 --> 00:00:28,174
Listen to it before continuing.

9
00:00:28,174 --> 00:00:31,628
Recording does not automatically transcribe speech.

10
00:00:32,083 --> 00:00:34,365
Add each physical material separately.

11
00:00:34,365 --> 00:00:38,809
Enter width and height, length or count, and choose or type its placement.

12
00:00:38,809 --> 00:00:44,214
Rectangular area is calculated from your entered measurements, never guessed from a photo.

13
00:00:44,667 --> 00:00:48,154
Capture or upload the site photo, then open Mark image.

14
00:00:48,154 --> 00:00:51,641
Draw a shape, arrow or freehand note in a clear colour.

15
00:00:51,641 --> 00:00:55,762
The material code and your dimensions appear on the marked image.

16
00:00:56,250 --> 00:01:00,219
Two boards made from the same material still need separate records.

17
00:01:00,219 --> 00:01:03,951
Each item keeps its own dimensions, placement and marked views.

18
00:01:03,951 --> 00:01:06,794
Save the marking before moving to the next item.

19
00:01:07,250 --> 00:01:09,913
Review the complete visit before submitting.

20
00:01:09,913 --> 00:01:13,424
Check the materials, measurements and saved marked photos.

21
00:01:13,424 --> 00:01:18,448
Download one marked image or the job image ZIP when you need to share the evidence.

22
00:01:18,917 --> 00:01:23,550
If something is unclear, raise a support issue by typing or recording it.

23
00:01:23,550 --> 00:01:26,026
Track Pending, Processing and Resolved.

24
00:01:26,026 --> 00:01:31,421
This client demo simulates support locally; it does not send messages to a real team.

25
00:01:31,875 --> 00:01:35,525
The collected details become a clear material report.

26
00:01:35,525 --> 00:01:40,003
Choose columns and export Excel or CSV, or print and save as PDF.

27
00:01:40,003 --> 00:01:43,722
Open the demo link and try the field journey yourself.

28
00:01:43,722 --> 00:01:45,719
Changes stay in your browser.
